		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Divine child with rainbow wings, part of celestial choir.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 18, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +2 (1) or countersong or hymn, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Countersong</strong>. Possessed or charmed mortals within double near make a CHA 15+ to be freed.</p><p></p><p><strong>Divine Aura</strong>. Hostile spells targeting the angel are DC 15. Mace dissolves if slain.</p><p></p><p><strong>Hymn</strong>. All chaotic beings who can hear within double near of angel, CHA 15+ or 2d6 damage. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
